              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "传说 — chuánshuō — \"legend; folk tale\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "zhège dìfang yǒu yí ge gǔlǎo de chuánshuō — This place has an old legend."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The new character, in pieces: 传 (chuán) — six strokes: the person piece 亻 on the left; on the right two bars, a stroke that runs down, turns right and sweeps down to the left, and a dot. The next lesson puts it in your hand."
            }
          ]
        },
