              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "传说 (chuánshuō) is built from 传 (chuán) 'to pass on' and 说 'to tell', both inherited from Middle Chinese, drjwen and sywet (Guangyun, in Baxter's transcription), which glosses the first 'to turn over, to pass along' and the second 'to tell'."
            }
